bw.msg.children=§7§o...are those children?
bw.msg.map_lost=§7Your map is gone. Someone kicked it into the creek.
bw.msg.cairns=§7You wake to three piles of stones around you. They weren't there last night.
bw.msg.bundle=§7There's a bundle of twigs on the ground beside you. Someone left it while you slept.
bw.msg.house=§7Through the trees to the §f%s§7 stands a ruined house. It shouldn't be there.
bw.msg.free=§7At last, a night away from the trees. The forest lets you go... for now.
bw.msg.touched=§4§oSomething touched you in the dark.
bw.msg.footage=§8A year later, §7%s§8's footage was found.
bw.msg.intro_1=§8[FOUND FOOTAGE]§r §7Every night you spend in the woods, something finds you a little sooner.
bw.msg.intro_2=§8[FOUND FOOTAGE]§r §7If you see stick figures in the trees, leave. If you see a house, don't go down to the basement.

